  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc5/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review @100b6fbb6e: fixture router=DefaultRouter(); router.register(r'events', views.EventViewSet); path('api/', include(router.urls)). Result: 0 ViewSet routes. The include() becomes a handler-less synthetic function route 'GET /api/' (view_name null). `hypergumbo routes` lists '[GET] /api/'. router.register is only an external_symbol call. The 'django:unknown' label in the title no longer appears; today the include shows as a fake GET route with no handler. MECHANISM: django route extraction reads only literal path()/re_path() calls; DRF router.register() and include(router.urls) indirection are not modelled. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: none."  # 36d6
